                    telegram No. 160, January 29, from the Ambassador in China, <ref
                        target="frus1946v10#pg_711">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1946, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">x</hi>, p. 711</ref>.</p>
            </note>
